BLOCK LEVEL ELEMENTS:
=====================
block level elements are the elements which occupies total space and always start on a new line eg : div tag , heading tag , list , table , paragraph

INLINE ELEMENTS:
================
inline elements are the elements which occupies necessary space 
which doesn't starts on a new line eg : span tag , anchor tag ,img tag , input tags 

DIV AND SPAN ELEMENTS:
=======================
   DIV:
   ------
   division elements which is used to group the sections for applying styles
   <div>
      <h1>codegnan</h1>
   </div>
   SPAN:
   ------
   span tag is used to apply styles for group of elements

SEMANTICS:
==================
semantics are used to convey the meaning about the content to the browser and developer

<header>content</header>
<nav>content</nav>
<section>content</section>
<aside>content</aside>
<article>content</article>
<footer>content</footer>

NON-SEMANTICS:
===============
<div>content</div>
<div>content</div>
<div>content</div>
<div>content</div>
<div>content</div>
<div>content</div>

